  unitName: Unholy Magress
  unitId: 60015
  unitNumber: 343
  description: A former knight from the utterly devastated Bariura Empire, he wielded
    a giant lance as one of the Six Heroes. While seeking revenge against the emperor
    who murdered his parents, he cut down countless gods and was eventually targeted
    directly by their leader. As the war waged on, Magress survived by absorbing
    the power of the gods. Taking on their skills as well as their equipment, it
    was said he took on a form that made him unrecognizable as a human.
  summonDesc: The dark power to absorb all<br>is exactly the power you need!<br>Summoner!
    Consume it all!
  fusionDesc: This power is all mine!<br>From god or man, it matters not!<br>Will
    you sacrifice yourself for me?
  evoDesc: This is my true power!<br>Let me express to you my anger<br>through my
    blade of vengeance!
  element: 6
  rarity: 5
